1
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:04,110
Lesson four, Nicole's day at school.

2
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:09,189
Nicole tells her mother Susan about her successful presentation at school.

3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:13,550
Her brother Ted overhears and interrupts the conversation.

4
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,709
How was your day at school today, Nicole?

5
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:18,709
It was great, mom.

6
00:00:19,179 --> 00:00:22,229
I gave a presentation on Hillary Clinton in government class.

7
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:25,149
Afterwards, my teacher paid me a compliment.

8
00:00:25,539 --> 00:00:26,469
What did she say?

9
00:00:27,039 --> 00:00:31,109
She said my presentation was head and shoulders above the others.

10
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:32,149
Way to go.

11
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:36,469
She also said I should go into politics just like Hillary.

12
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:39,589
You're so gung-ho about school. It drives me crazy.

13
00:00:40,219 --> 00:00:42,769
Ted, don't butt in. You're just jealous.

14
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:46,390
Right, you hit the nail on the head. I'm green with envy.

15
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:50,429
Would you just shut up? You're on thin ice with me right now.

16
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:53,589
Oh no, look at me. I'm shaking in my shoes.

17
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,429
You're on thin ice with me right now.

